Store builds download model weights at runtime and cache them in the browser.
Development builds may include local model files. CTD, panel, KoharuLayout and
text-cleanup conversions are served from c0ffeeOverdose/arn-manga-models.
Baberu OCR and Tesseract language data are downloaded from their upstream sources.
KoharuLayout also supports importing the same ONNX file locally. Its custom
model and training-data terms are separate from the extension's GPL license.

